00:13:29.310 --> 00:13:32.760
of those through agents
and existing APIs.

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:36.720
You surface your API, we
detect that and we discover it

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:39.570
with inside your application,
and then we are able

00:13:39.570 --> 00:13:44.520
to expose MCP tooling for you to
be able to incorporate and use

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:47.280
with inside your applications.

00:13:47.280 --> 00:13:51.180
It's all secured via Managed
Identity, OAuth, and RBAC,

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:55.050
so that we maintain
auditable API interactions.

00:13:55.050 --> 00:13:58.680
And it's language-agnostic,
with Built-In MCP,

00:13:58.680 --> 00:14:02.520
supports multiple programming
languages, so.NET, Java,

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:04.560
and Node.js, and Python,

00:14:04.560 --> 00:14:09.030
enabling broad
applicability throughout.

