00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:19.980
of where we've taken an
application that is running

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:22.080
on Managed Instance
on Azure App Service,

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:25.260
and it's a.NET
framework application,

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:27.870
and it's an inventory web API.

00:14:27.870 --> 00:14:31.140
So it's already
exposed in an API,

00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:34.590
and then using Azure App
