also to align with new paradigms

00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:17.220
and improvements that exist
with inside the technologies

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:20.130
that evolved over years.

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:24.630
It means that using GitHub
Copilot you can have extremely

00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:27.150
fast Greenfield development.

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:28.980
So now with the correct prompts

