00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:35.640
we can generate new APIs,
test deployment scripts,

00:17:35.640 --> 00:17:39.030
spin up prototypes very
quickly, and turn those more

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:44.460
into new applications
very, very quickly.

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:47.910
The GitHub app modernization
tooling supports multiple

